# Raw downloads: re-fetched by scripts/run_all.py; WIPO data may not be redistributed
data/raw/

# IPUMS USA microdata: the terms of use forbid redistribution. Never commit extracts or
# person-level derived files, wherever they are saved. Aggregated tables (counts by year
# and occupation, in output/) may be shared with the IPUMS citation.
data/raw/ipums/
data/processed/ipums*/
**/usa_[0-9]*.csv*
**/usa_[0-9]*.dat*
**/usa_[0-9]*.xml
**/usa_[0-9]*.cbk

